.TH Command NUKE
.SY "nuke <SECTS>"
The nuke report prints a listing of all the nuclear "devices" in a given area.
.s3
.EX "nuke #1"
.NF +0.3i
nuke x,y   fail x,y  size
   2,-12     14,64     1
   2,-12     14,62     2
   2,-12     14,60     1
   8,-10      8,54     1
.FI
.s3
